sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant G as API Gateway
  participant A as Order API
  participant P as Product Catalog API
  participant D as DynamoDB Orders
  participant S as DynamoDB Streams
  participant O as Lambda Outbox Publisher
  participant E as EventBridge

  C->>G: POST /orders + JWT + Idempotency-Key
  G->>A: Authorized request + correlation context
  A->>A: Validate request and idempotency key
  A->>P: GET product snapshots
  P-->>A: Product data
  A->>D: Conditional transaction: order + items + idempotency record
  D-->>A: Persisted
  A-->>C: 201 Created
  D-->>S: Stream record
  S->>O: Invoke with stream record
  O->>E: Publish order.created.v1
